  "articleBody": "Deciding to build an Accessory Dwelling Unit is a big step, and choosing between an attached or detached structure can be a tough call. An attached ADU isn't just a room addition; it's a distinct living space that shares a wall with your primary home. Understanding when this option makes the most sense for your property and lifestyle in Los Angeles County can really help narrow down your plans.",
